   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "During the celebration in the kitchen, Chef Viktor examines Max's passport on the counter. Looking at the official stamp, Viktor notices that Max's birthday is actually in February, uncovering Max's well-intentioned lie. Let's listen to their conversation in Russian first.",
