   "t": "'Show me your passport, Max.' -- Chef Viktor asks to inspect the document.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Вот мой паспорт, шеф.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Here is my passport, chef.' -- Max hands over his official ID to the boss.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "chef",
   "t": "А почему день рождения в феврале?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'And why is the birthday in February?' -- The chef spots the contradictory date in the passport.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Твой день рождения не сегодня?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Your birthday is not today?' -- Senya expresses surprise at the sudden revelation.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Я хотел сделать вам приятное.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
