   "t": "'I wanted to please you.' -- Max explains his benevolent motivation to them.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "chef",
   "t": "Ты соврал нам про праздник?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Did you lie to us about the holiday?' -- The chef questions his honesty with concern.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Я хотел забыть все обиды.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I wanted to forget all grudges.' -- Max admits that he sought peace.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Но врать друзьям нельзя.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'But one must not lie to friends.' -- Senya reminds him of the importance of loyalty.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "chef",
   "t": "Любая ложь — это плохо.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Any lie is bad.' -- Viktor states a fundamental moral truth to the team.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
