   "t": "Я очень виноват перед вами.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I am very guilty before you.' -- Max takes responsibility for his mistake.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "chef",
   "t": "За любой обман надо отвечать.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'For any deceit one must answer.' -- The chef insists on accountability for the act.",
   "gap": 0.4
